5.5 Microsoft 365 Service Health

The Microsoft 365 Admin Center includes service-health information.

If many users suddenly report that Outlook or Teams is unavailable, service health can help determine whether there is a Microsoft 365 service-side issue.

Help Desk Principle

Do not troubleshoot each computer independently when the evidence suggests a company-wide service problem.
